133
00:20:48,650 --> 00:20:51,770
Mano energija niekada neišseks!

134
00:21:49,080 --> 00:21:51,580
C-Cellas!

135
00:21:55,260 --> 00:21:57,610
<i>At last, Cell has appeared!</i>

136
00:22:20,660 --> 00:22:25,950
<i>Has the time at last come for him to merge with No.17 and No.18?</i>

137
00:22:43,880 --> 00:22:47,820
{\an8}<i>kakete kuru yo appuru iro monsutaa</i>

138
00:22:43,880 --> 00:22:47,820
<i>Štai atskrieja obuolio spalvos monstras</i>

139
00:22:47,820 --> 00:22:53,730
{\an8}<i>tonde kuru yo nattsu no kaori eirian</i>

140
00:22:47,820 --> 00:22:53,730
<i>Štai atskrenda riešutais kvepiantis ateivis</i>

141
00:22:53,730 --> 00:22:56,450
{\an8}<i>deatte dokkin-dokkin</i>

142
00:22:53,730 --> 00:22:56,450
<i>Sutikus juos, širdis ima daužytis,</i>

143
00:22:56,450 --> 00:22:58,160
{\an8}<i>dokkin-dokkin</i>

144
00:22:56,450 --> 00:22:58,160
<i>daužytis vis smarkiau</i>

145
00:22:59,390 --> 00:23:04,600
{\an8}<i>pika-pika ginga wa poppukoon shawaa</i>

146
00:22:59,390 --> 00:23:04,600
<i>Žėrinti galaktika – tarsi spragsinčių kukurūzų lietus</i>

147
00:23:06,720 --> 00:23:11,110
{\an8}<i>kinou ni bai-bai-bai (Go-ha-n)</i>

148
00:23:06,720 --> 00:23:11,110
<i>Vakarui tariu sudie-die-die (Go-ha-n)</i>

149
00:23:11,110 --> 00:23:15,090
{\an8}<i>fu-shi-gi (ip-pa-i)</i>

150
00:23:11,110 --> 00:23:15,090
<i>Pas-lap-tis (visur aplink)</i>

151
00:23:15,090 --> 00:23:18,470
{\an8}<i>chikara o komete (okawari OK)</i>

152
00:23:15,090 --> 00:23:18,470
<i>Sukaupk jėgas (pakartoti porciją galima)</i>

153
00:23:18,470 --> 00:23:21,130
{\an8}<i>kochira e rai-rai-rai</i>

154
00:23:18,470 --> 00:23:21,130
<i>Ateik čionai, lai-lai-lai</i>

155
00:23:22,930 --> 00:23:28,270
{\an8}<i>Woh... mirakuru ZENKAI pawaa!</i>

156
00:23:22,930 --> 00:23:28,270
<i>Ooo... stebuklinga ZENKAI galia!</i>

157
00:23:30,730 --> 00:23:32,600
{\an8}<i>haraheri wanpaku Kinto'un</i>

158
00:23:30,730 --> 00:23:32,600
<i>Alkanas, išdykęs Kinto'unas</i>

159
00:23:32,600 --> 00:23:34,810
{\an8}<i>yama hodo takusan suiheisen</i>

160
00:23:32,600 --> 00:23:34,810
<i>Horizontų – kalnai</i>

161
00:23:34,810 --> 00:23:38,610
{\an8}<i>deatte wakarete deatte wakarete ta-i-he-n</i>

162
00:23:34,810 --> 00:23:38,610
<i>Susitinka, išsiskiria, vėl susitinka – tikra bėda</i>

163
00:23:38,610 --> 00:23:44,400
{\an8}<i>Ah mou Kami-sama mo tsurai yo ne!</i>

164
00:23:38,610 --> 00:23:44,400
<i>Ak, net Dievui nelengva!</i>

165
00:23:44,400 --> 00:23:45,620
{\an8}<i>... go-men</i>

166
00:23:44,400 --> 00:23:45,620
<i>...Atsip-ra-šau</i>

167
00:23:46,950 --> 00:23:52,120
{\an8}<i>Woh... manpuku ZENKAI pawaa!</i>

168
00:23:46,950 --> 00:23:52,120
<i>Ooo... soti ZENKAI galia!</i>

169
00:23:54,500 --> 00:23:59,780
{\an8}<i>detekoi tobikiri ZENKAI pawaa!</i>

170
00:23:54,500 --> 00:23:59,780
<i>Pasirodyk, nepaprasta ZENKAI galia!</i>

171
00:24:06,760 --> 00:24:10,100
{\an8}Preview

172
00:24:10,560 --> 00:24:12,100
<i>Heya! I'm Goku!</i>

173
00:24:12,100 --> 00:24:13,970
<i>Damn, what a ki.</i>

174
00:24:13,970 --> 00:24:16,580
<i>Cell has raised his power like crazy.</i>

175
00:24:16,580 --> 00:24:19,320
<i>Stop, Piccolo! Not even you're a match for him!</i>

176
00:24:19,320 --> 00:24:20,480
<i>Curse you, Cell!</i>

177
00:24:20,480 --> 00:24:22,860
<i>Just how many people have you sacrificed?!</i>

178
00:24:22,860 --> 00:24:24,940
<i>I won't let you reach your perfect form!</i>

179
00:24:25,280 --> 00:24:26,950
<i>Next time on Dragon Ball Z:</i>

180
00:24:26,950 --> 00:24:30,620
<i>"The Suicide Counterattack Proves Ineffective! Piccolo's Flame Burns Out!!"</i>

181
00:24:30,620 --> 00:24:33,120
<i>Oh, no! Piccolo-san's ki is fading out!</i>

182
00:24:33,110 --> 00:24:36,620
{\an8}Next time

183
00:24:33,110 --> 00:24:36,620
{\an8}The Suicide Counterattack Proves Ineffective!

